idge/.ai-team/runs/dsh-agy-bridge-resilience-20261018/architecture/arch-spec.md:157:| 11 | `test_kill_group_cleans_descendants_and_reaps_zombie` | `sh -c 'sleep 100 & sleep 100 & wait'`; после `_kill_group`: `proc.returncode is not None`, `os.killpg(pgid, 0)` → `ProcessLookupError`, `ps -o stat= -p <pid>` пуст (нет `Z`) |\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/dsh-agy-bridge-resilience-20261018/architecture/arch-spec.md:158:| 12 | `test_kill_group_reaps_when_group_already_gone` | процесс завершён заранее; `_kill_group` не падает и вызывает `proc.wait` (нет зомби) |\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.ai-team/runs/dsh-agy-bridge-resilience-20261018/architecture/arch-spec.md:159:| 13 | `test_kill_group_escalates_to_sigkill` | процесс игнорирует `SIGTERM` (`trap '' TERM`); завершён ≤ 2.0 + 5.0 с, через `SIGKILL` |\nAGENTS.md absent\n.agents/AGENTS.md absent\nCLAUDE.md absent\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/AGENTS.md absent\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/.agents/AGENTS.md absent\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/CLAUDE.md absent\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
